p><strong><img src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/15.0.3/72x72/1f4a5.png\" alt=\"💥\" class=\"wp-smiley\" style=\"height: 1em; max-height: 1em;\" /> Chủ đề 1: Quy trình xử lý mã độc chuyên nghiệp cho website WordPress</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Speaker: Nguyễn Xuân Bình Minh &#8211; CEO Minh Duy Solutions</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/15.0.3/72x72/1f4a5.png\" alt=\"💥\" class=\"wp-smiley\" style=\"height: 1em; max-height: 1em;\" /> Chủ đề 2: Bí quyết x10 doanh số với chiến lược phễu bán hàng trong WordPress</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Speaker: Nguyễn Minh Phụng &#8211; CEO Công ty TNHH Giải Pháp ETI</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/15.0.3/72x72/1f4a5.png\" alt=\"💥\" class=\"wp-smiley\" style=\"height: 1em; max-height: 1em;\" /> Chủ đề 3: 5 Ways to increase your Businesses Profits</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Speaker: Hà Anh Lĩnh &#8211; CEO Công ty TNHH TM &amp; DV ANHLINHMKT</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/15.0.3/72x72/1f3af.png\" alt=\"🎯\" class=\"wp-smiley\" style=\"height: 1em; max-height: 1em;\" /> Phí tham dự:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>&#8211; Miễn phí tham dự</p>\n\n\n\n<p>&#8211; Số lượng tối đa: 30 người</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/15.0.3/72x72/1f3af.png\" alt=\"🎯\" class=\"wp-smiley\" style=\"height: 1em; max-height: 1em;\" /> Đơn vị tài trợ chính:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p><img src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/15.0.3/72x72/2b50.png\" alt=\"⭐\" class=\"wp-smiley\" style=\"height: 1em; max-height: 1em;\" /> Công ty TNHH Xây Dựng &amp; Công Nghệ Quỳnh An (Quỳnh An Solar)</p>\n\n\n\n<p><img src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/15.0.3/72x72/2b50.png\" alt=\"⭐\" class=\"wp-smiley\" style=\"height: 1em; max-height: 1em;\" /> CÔNG TY CỔ PHẦN FUTE (Web2M &amp; Pay2S)</p>\n\n\n\n<p><img src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/15.0.3/72x72/1f3af.png\" alt=\"🎯\" class=\"wp-smiley\" style=\"height: 1em; max-height: 1em;\" /> Đơn vị tổ chức: Minh Duy Solutions &amp; Minh Duy Event</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"></figure>\n\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:36:\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\";a:1:{s:10:\"commentRss\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:96:\"https://vi.wordpress.org/2024/08/25/hinh-anh-su-kien-nha-trang-wordpress-meetup-25-08-2024/feed/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:38:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\";a:1:{s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:1:\"2\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:30:\"com-wordpress:feed-additions:1\";a:1:{s:7:\"post-id\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:4:\"1175\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}i:1;a:6:{s:4:\"data\";s:79:\"\n		\n		\n					\n		\n		\n		\n				\n		\n		\n		\n\n					\n										\n					\n					\n			\n		\n		\n			\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"child\";a:6:{s:0:\"\";a:7:{s:5:\"title\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:58:\"Đăng ký tham dự Nha Trang WordPress Meetup 25/08/2024\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"link\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:90:\"https://vi.wordpress.org/2024/08/09/dang-ky-tham-du-nha-trang-wordpress-meetup-25-08-2024/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:98:\"https://vi.wordpress.org/2024/08/09/dang-ky-tham-du-nha-trang-wordpress-meetup-25-08-2024/#respond\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xm